<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Event Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; color: #333;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color:#1f90d1; color:#fff; text-align:center; padding:10px; border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;">
        <h1 style="margin:0; font-size:24px;">Event Confirmation</h1>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:20px;">
        <p>Dear <strong>{{guestName}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Thank you for confirming your attendance. We’re excited to have you join us for <strong>{{eventName}}</strong>.</p>
        
        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f9f9f9; padding:15px; border-radius:6px;">
          <tr>
            <td>
              <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Event Details</h3>
              <ul style="padding-left:20px; margin:0;">
                <li><strong>Date:</strong> {{eventDate}}</li>
                <li><strong>Time:</strong> {{eventTime}}</li>
                <li><strong>Venue:</strong> {{eventVenue}}</li>
              </ul>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <p>Please keep this email as your confirmation. A reminder will be sent one day before the event.</p>
       

        <p>Best regards,<br><strong>{{organizerName}}</strong></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
